<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer prices rise 0.1 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer prices rise 0.1 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish consumer prices rose by 0.1 percent in January, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>    SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES     Jan 97    Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +0.1	-0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    -0.1	-0.2	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980)	 254.6     254.9	255.6</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected consumer prices to rise by 0.4 percent in January for a year-on-year rate of 0.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
